--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 The generated prompt names the output `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Charging/
 CostAnalysisPage.swift`, and the gate scans that exact path. The repo's app
 targets, however, glob their sources from `Sources`, `TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets`
