 ARCHITECTURE NOTES (no scope narrowing):
   - Page is Shared-free: the KMP `Shared.xcframework` is not buildable on this
     runner and the facade (Units/AppContainer/LoadableState) imports it; the
     feature views are Shared-free, so the page binds a `CostAnalysisSource` seam
     (the same pattern every feature view uses) and derives datasets locally.
   - Composes the 8 EXISTING cost-analysis feature views (CostSummaryCards,
     CostPerKwhChart, ChargerTypeBreakdown, SavingsCalculator, CostForecastSection,
     LifetimeSummary, EnvironmentalImpact, LoadingSkeleton) via their real
     models built from InMemory*Source(initial: *Update(...)).
   - The 4 web regions with no feature-view component yet (MonthlyCostChart,
     MonthlyCostTable, TimeOfUseAnalysis, AICostForecastNarration) are reproduced
     in-scope as native sections (Swift Charts / Grid). Unique `Cost*`/`CA*` type
     names — a module-wide grep confirms zero symbol collisions.

